From 2f34b76e67f8efc5930fdd084d68d089c109f2ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 06:53:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(laporan): render placeholder with dummy data instead of
 live DB queries
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Previous commit swapped the Laporan grid tile to a bare icon-only
PlaceholderScreen after the real, DB-wired LaporanScreen rendered
blank in testing. That was more than asked for: the tile should stay
on LaporanScreen and show its full designed body (trend chart, 4 stat
cards, transaction list) — just backed by fake numbers instead of
LaporanRepository's queries against transactions/cash_expenses, which
are owned by other features (POS/Arus Kas) and are the suspected
cause of the blank render.

- Revert menu_grid_items.dart's Laporan tile back to LaporanScreen
  (undo the placeholderTile swap).
- Add laporan_dummy_data.dart: static Pendapatan/Pengeluaran
  ReportData (deterministic trend, plausible totals, a handful of
  dummy rows) — same in-memory-dummy approach as
  pelanggan_dummy_data.dart.
- LaporanController.load() now builds its data from LaporanDummyData
  instead of awaiting LaporanRepository, keeping the same
  isLoading/error/request-guard control flow so swapping the real
  source back in later is a small diff.
- laporan_repository.dart and laporan_screen.dart doc comments updated
  to say the repository isn't currently called and why; the repository
  code itself is untouched, ready to re-wire once the actual blank-
  render bug is isolated.
